From cb63614f657739543383464014bc64bab7172323 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2026 12:17:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore(geno-audit): bring geno-notes into ecosystem compliance

- S3: align geno_notes/__init__.__version__ from 0.2.0 to 0.1.0
  (genotools.yaml is the canonical version source)
- S6: add versioning guidance to GENO.md Conventions section
- S11: remove /gt-notes inline example from prefix-aliasing bullet
  in GENO.md; use neutral alias-config language instead
---
 GENO.md                | 3 ++-
 geno_notes/__init__.py | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/GENO.md b/GENO.md
index ac91d45..072ddd3 100644
--- a/GENO.md
+++ b/GENO.md
@@ -54,8 +54,9 @@ geno-notes/
 
 - Sub-skillsets have their own `skills/{name}/SKILL.md` and dispatch to the `geno-notes` CLI.
 - The umbrella slash command `/geno-notes` dispatches to the `geno-notes` CLI binary.
-- **Prefix aliasing**: slash commands use the canonical `geno-` prefix in source (e.g., `/geno-notes`). Short `/gt-` aliases (e.g., `/gt-notes`) are configured per-installation by `geno-tools` and are not defined in this repo.
+- **Prefix aliasing**: slash commands use the canonical `geno-` prefix in source (e.g., `/geno-notes`). User-configured short aliases are applied at install time by `geno-tools` and are never defined in this repo.
 - **Adding a new skill**: create a directory under `skills/` named after the skill, write a `SKILL.md` with YAML frontmatter (name, description, allowed-tools, etc.), add the skill to the Skills table above, and register it in `package.json` under the `skills` map.
+- **Versioning**: `genotools.yaml` is the canonical version source. Keep `pyproject.toml` `project.version`, `package.json` `version`, `geno_notes/__init__.py` `__version__`, and root `SKILL.md` `metadata.version` in sync with it. Bump the version whenever skills are added, removed, or behavior changes.
 
 ## Architecture
 
diff --git a/geno_notes/__init__.py b/geno_notes/__init__.py
index af36085..1504df3 100644
--- a/geno_notes/__init__.py
+++ b/geno_notes/__init__.py
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 """geno-notes — project wiki with two-scope storage."""
 
-__version__ = "0.2.0"
+__version__ = "0.1.0"
 SCHEMA_VERSION = "0.2.0"
